#: ../../source/unit/dualbutton.rst:2
msgid "Dual Button Unit"
msgstr "双按键 Unit"

#: ../../source/unit/dualbutton.rst:6
msgid ""
"The Dual Button Unit provides two independent buttons. Use "
"``DualButtonUnit`` for click, double-click, hold, and callback handling, "
"or ``SimpleDualButtonUnit`` for direct pin reads and debounced edge "
"polling."
msgstr ""
"Dual Button Unit 提供两个独立按键。使用 ``DualButtonUnit`` 可处理单击、"
"双击、长按和回调；使用 ``SimpleDualButtonUnit`` 可直接读取引脚并轮询消抖后的"
"边沿事件。"

