#: ../../source/unit/dualbutton.rst:118
msgid "SimpleDualButtonUnit"
msgstr "SimpleDualButtonUnit"

#: ../../source/unit/dualbutton.rst:122
msgid "Create two :class:`SimpleButton` objects for direct polling."
msgstr "创建两个用于直接轮询的 :class:`SimpleButton` 对象。"

#: ../../source/unit/dualbutton.rst:125
msgid ""
"Use low level as the active state when ``True``. Active-low inputs use an"
" internal pull-up and active-high inputs use an internal pull-down."
msgstr "为 ``True`` 时使用低电平作为有效状态。低电平有效输入使用内部上拉，高电平有效输入使用内部下拉。"

#: ../../source/unit/dualbutton.rst:128
msgid ""
"Time in milliseconds that an input must remain stable before generating "
"an edge event. Set to ``0`` to disable debounce."
msgstr "输入在生成边沿事件前必须保持稳定的时间，单位为毫秒。设为 ``0`` 可禁用消抖。"

#: ../../source/unit/dualbutton.rst:131
msgid "The blue and red button objects."
msgstr "蓝色和红色按键对象。"

#: ../../source/unit/dualbutton.rst:135
msgid "SimpleButton"
msgstr "SimpleButton"

#: ../../source/unit/dualbutton.rst:139
msgid "Provide direct pin reads and debounced edge polling without callbacks."
msgstr "提供无需回调的直接引脚读取和消抖边沿轮询。"

#: ../../source/unit/dualbutton.rst:141
msgid ""
"Call :meth:`SimpleButton.update` regularly before reading edge events. "
"The :meth:`SimpleButton.value` and :meth:`SimpleButton.is_active` methods"
" read the pin directly and do not require ``update()``."
msgstr ""
"读取边沿事件前需定期调用 :meth:`SimpleButton.update`。:meth:`SimpleButton.value` 和 "
":meth:`SimpleButton.is_active` 方法会直接读取引脚，无需调用 ``update()``。"

#: ../../source/unit/dualbutton.rst:147
msgid "Return the raw pin value."
msgstr "返回原始引脚值。"

#: ../../source/unit/dualbutton.rst:149
msgid "``0`` or ``1``."
msgstr "``0`` 或 ``1``。"

#: ../../source/unit/dualbutton.rst:154
msgid "Return whether the button is currently active according to ``active_low``."
msgstr "根据 ``active_low`` 返回按键当前是否处于有效状态。"

#: ../../source/unit/dualbutton.rst:157
msgid "``True`` when the button is active."
msgstr "按键处于有效状态时返回 ``True``。"

#: ../../source/unit/dualbutton.rst:162
msgid ""
"Sample the pin and update the debounced edge state. Call this method once"
" per loop iteration."
msgstr "采样引脚并更新消抖后的边沿状态。每次循环迭代调用一次此方法。"

#: ../../source/unit/dualbutton.rst:167
msgid ""
"Return whether a debounced press was detected by the latest call to "
":meth:`SimpleButton.update`."
msgstr "返回最近一次调用 :meth:`SimpleButton.update` 是否检测到消抖后的按下事件。"

#: ../../source/unit/dualbutton.rst:174
msgid ""
"Return whether a debounced release was detected by the latest call to "
":meth:`SimpleButton.update`."
msgstr "返回最近一次调用 :meth:`SimpleButton.update` 是否检测到消抖后的释放事件。"

